Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Present drawings or structured specifications, finish samples, assumptions, and acceptance criteria for customer confirmation. Bind the quote to the accepted revision, then create production work only after material scope and commercial terms are approved.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
